### Inside the band

Every grade 10 row assumes its grade 9 row, every grade 11 row its grade 10 row and every grade 12 row its grade 11 row; the course teaches each, so a later unit opens with retrieval, never a "Given:" item, unless a school left the earlier unit out (STANDARD section 5.6) or a student joins after grade 9 (The course in brief, Days).

