108: | RD2 (CASEL.Responsible Decision-Making.2) | g9-rds-check-facts (5) | g10-rds-check-facts (12) | g11-rds-check-facts (15) | g12-rds-check-facts (23) | Grade 10: The other person's reasons for a belief join the data check. Grade 11: Evidence weighed when the choice has a price. Grade 12: Checks the facts of a choice past school. |
109: | RD6 (CASEL.Responsible Decision-Making.6) | g9-rds-good-for-us (5) | g10-rds-good-for-us (12) | g11-rds-good-for-us (18) | g12-rds-good-for-us (22) | Grade 10: This year the plan weighs a second person's well-being as fully as one's own. Grade 11: Well-being with a price. Grade 12: Balances well-being in adult life. |
110: | RD4 (CASEL.Responsible Decision-Making.4) | g9-rds-think-ahead (5) | g10-rds-think-ahead (10) | g11-rds-think-ahead (15) | g12-rds-think-ahead (23) | Grade 10: Adds the friend's results to the plan. Grade 11: Adds what a choice costs and whether it can be undone. Grade 12: Thinks ahead about adult choices. |
