**Location:** Models carried; unit 3; seam descriptions; progression rows `g6-sm-calm-down`, `g6-rel-stand-up` and `g6-rel-ask-offer-help`.

The paragraph headed �?oNew in this band�?? includes refusal, fairness and upstander cards already taught in grades 3 to 5. The upstander row�?Ts step-up still describes a move from one planned response to choosing among options, although the earlier band already offers options.

The calm-down card also changes �?ochoose�?? to �?opick a tool�?? while claiming simply to add �?ogo on.�??

**Why it matters:** Writers can mistake retrieval for first teaching and produce inconsistent cards across subjects.

**Exact fix:**

