g9-rel-teamwork | ~CASEL.Relationship Skills.4 | in:talk turn card | out:talk turn card | cross:health:g9-meh-teams-negotiate-views (health on teamwork and negotiation in many settings) | Unit 6, Goals with others. The team designs its own plan for a shared project (roles, norms, how to raise a problem), carries it out, and holds a short look-back at the end to judge what to keep and change. Step up from grade 8: from carrying a project under a deadline to designing and judging the team's way of working.
g9-rel-lead-follow | ~CASEL.Relationship Skills.7 | in:talk turn card | out:talk turn card | cross: | Unit 6, Goals with others. The student plans how to lead a team session (an agenda, how the group will decide, how to hear every voice), runs it, follows when another member leads, and judges both roles from team feedback. Step up from grade 8: from leading one unpopular decision to planning and judging a whole session.
