| g8-rel-friendships (RS2) | 17 | g9-rel-friendships (unit 4) | From choosing to step back to designing what to say and what limit to hold. |
| g8-rel-settle-disagreements (RS5) | 17 | g9-rel-settle-disagreements (unit 4) | From negotiating one compromise to planning a fix and checking it held. |
